- Mercedes-Benz Special Tool 276589001100
- Torque wrench (10-300 Nm)
- Diagnostic scanner with Mercedes software

## Preliminary Work
1. Park vehicle on level ground
2. Apply parking brake
3. Disconnect battery negative terminal
