| Component | Torque (Nm) | Thread Lock |
|-----------|------------|-------------|
| Main bolts | 85 ± 5 | Loctite 243 |
| Cover bolts | 25 ± 3 | None |
| Drain plug | 40 ± 5 | New seal |

## Final Steps
1. Reconnect battery
2. Clear any fault codes
3. Perform road test
4. Document work completed

